sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Pane as Side-Pane UI (app.html)
    participant Server as MCP Server (index.mjs)
    participant Voice as Voice Engine (voice.mjs)
    participant Disk as parking_lot.json + screenshots/
    participant Agent as Antigravity Chat Agent

    Note over User,Agent: Phase 1 — Antigravity Is Actively Working (Do Not Interrupt)
    Agent->>Agent: Executing long-running coding or research task
    User->>Pane: Clicks "+" -> "Parking Lot" in Side Pane
    Pane->>Server: app_get_state({})
    Server->>Disk: Read items + saved draft
    Disk-->>Server: Snapshot JSON
    Server-->>Pane: Render parked ideas & restore unsent draft

    opt Paste / Drop / Pick Screenshot ("Ctrl+V" or "📷 Image")
        User->>Pane: Pastes snip (Ctrl+V) or drops image
        Pane->>Server: app_upload_screenshot({ dataUrl, thumbDataUrl })
        Server->>Disk: Write image to screenshots/ss_xxxx.png
        Server-->>Pane: Render thumbnail & auto-save draft
    end

    opt Voice-to-Text Dictation ("🎤 Voice" or Alt+V)
        User->>Pane: Clicks "🎤 Voice" and speaks idea
        Pane->>Server: app_voice_start({})
        Server->>Voice: Start Windows Neural / Offline Speech Recognizer
        loop Every 350ms while speaking
            Pane->>Server: app_voice_poll({ cursor })
            Voice-->>Server: Recognized text segments + live partial
            Server-->>Pane: Append text into composer & auto-save draft
        end
        User->>Pane: Clicks "⏹ Stop"
        Pane->>Server: app_voice_stop({ cursor })
    end

    User->>Pane: Types or edits idea -> presses Ctrl+Enter ("+ Park Idea")
    Pane->>Server: app_save_item({ prompt, project, priority, clearDraft: true })
    Server->>Disk: Atomic write new item + clear draft
    Note right of Server: Agent is untouched!
    Server-->>Pane: Updated snapshot (Toast: "Idea parked!")

    Note over User,Agent: Phase 2 — User Is Ready to Send Idea(s) to Antigravity
    Agent-->>User: Finishes current task (Idle)
    alt Single or Batch "Send Here" / "New Chat"
        User->>Pane: Clicks "Send Here" (or selects multiple -> "Send (N)")
        Pane->>Agent: app.sendMessage({ role: "user", content })
        Pane->>Server: app_set_status({ ids, status: "done", incrementLaunch: true })
        Server->>Disk: Mark item(s) done & increment launchCount
        Server-->>Pane: Refresh Parked / Done counts
    else Attach as Context to Next Message
        User->>Pane: Clicks "Attach" on one or more ideas
        Pane->>Agent: app.updateModelContext({ content })
        User->>Agent: Sends custom chat message with attached context
    end
